WEBVTT

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.480
The Song of Healing
that Finis threw away...

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.250
What does this mean?

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:45.120
Who's there?!

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.090
What's a baby doing here?

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:54.220
Poor thing.

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:07.150
Grandpa?

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:33.960
No way. This is...

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:49.230
From now on, this child will be part
of our family.

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:51.230
My little sister?

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:53.820
Yeah, that's right.

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:55.610
What's her name?

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:57.530
Her name?

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.700
Well...

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:04.790
Hey. What do you think about "Rin"?

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:07.410
Rin?

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:10.710
That's a nice name.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.310
The Song of Determination

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.310
She's sleeping.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:53.190
Rin is so cute.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:55.690
Yeah, you're right.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:04:00.360
I was created by Finis's song.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.900
My name is Mel.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:05.070
I'm your big sister.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:07.660
Mel.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:09.240
Grandpa.

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.080
Excuse me.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:17.710
Mr. Hawkray. It's almost time.

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:19.420
I understand.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.510
Are you going to the Capital again?

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.510
-Yeah.
-Why?

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:31.220
You're not the general anymore, right?

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:36.270
Sorry, Mel.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:51.950
There, there.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.750
It'll be okay. Everything is all right.

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.710
Grandpa went with the Capital soldier?

00:04:58.290 --> 00:04:59.380
Who's Mr. Hawkray?

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:00.800
Don't cry!

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.640
I can't allow this!

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:19.270
Grandpa and...

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:20.900
Bazra?!

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:22.780
And the genius old man!

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:28.160
Talgia Hawkray, what do you mean,
you can't allow this?

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:31.700
Using the power of the girl
who sings for war

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:34.160
isn't something
that the Capital Army should do!

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.620
And this song is...

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:41.130
If the legends are true,
then this song will destroy the world!

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:42.210
Don't worry.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:45.420
We're just obliterating
a neighboring country.

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:48.130
To serve as a beacon of war.

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:52.850
So, is this the reason
that a mere mercenary like you

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:55.060
was promoted
through the ranks so quickly?

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:57.980
Are you okay with that,

00:05:58.730 --> 00:05:59.560
Finis?!

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:04.820
Finis!

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:15.250
Henry Leobolt?

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:19.620
Although we've never met before,
I've come to save you.

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.130
You can't do anything alone.

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:27.970
Finis?

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:32.010
This is too cruel.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.180
Everything... is meaningless.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:40.100
-What are you saying?
-History repeats itself.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:42.360
The world will end.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.270
You, too, will die.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:49.110
You will probably be killed by me.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:56.370
-Did you hear that?
-No way.

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:59.580
-You're being forced to sing, right?
-Hey.

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:05.000
Get off your high horse already,

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:07.130
you traitor.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:11.090
Are the songs in that Echo Device
all from Finis?

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:13.680
Of course.

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:16.220
<i>She stays inside an anechoic chamber</i>

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:20.480
<i>and fills the Echo Device</i>
<i>with the power of songs forever.</i>

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:25.650
That's what you've been doing alone?
All this time...

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:29.610
It's none of your concern.

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:33.030
She'll have a few friends joining her.

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:34.570
What do you mean?!

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:37.540
Did you forget the person
who saved your life?

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.160
If I recall, it was a brat named Rin.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:43.460
That girl?

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:55.180
I can't let you die just yet.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:59.930
You're gonna tell me where that brat is.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:05.980
Where are we headed?

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:08.110
To where General Bazra is.

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:10.610
Our leader is fighting alone.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:13.700
You're quite impressive,
Leobolt the hottie!

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:15.910
What's wrong with her?

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:19.790
Don't worry about her. She's a bit crazy.

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.330
-What?! The enemy!
-Enemy attack!

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:31.460
Hey! Why are there Capital soldiers
along this road?

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:35.680
Don't ask me! I can barely see the road
with all of this ash!

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:38.890
Wait! Stop!

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:40.470
What?

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.690
Hey. What are you looking at?

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:46.940
The ash is moving.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.230
What?

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:52.150
You're right. The wind's not even blowing.

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:55.160
It's flowing toward our leader.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:58.320
The enemy is here! This way!

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:04.080
We're outnumbered. Let's hurry
and get to our leader.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:09.420
I hope Rin made it back to the carriage.

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:21.010
<i>Grandpa!</i>

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:30.020
You're a tough geezer!

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:40.660
Impressive. As expected,
Hawkray the master swordsman.

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:46.290
No wonder you were a famous general
all throughout Neunatia.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.670
I have to stop you right here.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.880
The world is going to become embroiled
in war over Finis again.

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:55.760
I will stop you,
even if it means we both die!

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:57.180
Burn and die!

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:00.050
Grandpa!

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:07.640
-You can't reach me. You can't reach me!
-Hey!

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:09.230
What are you doing?

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.860
Are you okay, Talgia?

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:15.320
You're interfering.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:18.490
You bastard! What have you done?

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:32.630
Now he'll never be able to wield
a sword again.

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:00.410
Grandpa.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:02.740
Grandpa!

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.830
I finished gathering nuts!

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:06.660
I'm going to play now!

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:10.170
-Look!
-Oh, thanks.

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:14.630
Rin, sit here for a bit.

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:18.170
-Here we go.
-Yay!

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:22.300
Grandpa, are you going to stay
in the village forever now?

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:25.220
Yeah, I'll be here.
I'll be with you forever.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:26.600
Yay!

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:33.900
There, there.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.360
Sorry, Rin.

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:43.110
Grandpa, hold Rin.

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:44.700
Are you sure?

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:47.870
Yeah. I'm the big sister, after all!

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:50.500
You're right.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.330
Isn't that nice, Rin?

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:00.170
Sorry. I can't move that hand.

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:06.390
<i>A song that awakens</i>

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:07.930
A song?

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:10.850
<i>And calls</i>

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:12.140
The Song of Healing.

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:13.560
<i>People</i>

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:16.190
<i>Repeat the song</i>

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:18.190
<i>In their hearts</i>

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:19.110
Grandpa!

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:27.370
What?

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:30.500
I can move my hand!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:36.040
Could it be? Does this child also have
the power of songs?

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:43.680
I'll protect you.

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:46.930
I'll protect you, no matter what.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:49.720
Grandpa?

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:51.350
Mel.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:56.150
Our family is going to live
a quiet life together from now on.

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:03.900
Grandpa!

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:29.390
What's going on?

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:35.270
Is that Rin?

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:39.940
Rin!

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:43.230
<i>Finis...</i>

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:53.950
Finis...

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.880
I saw everything.

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:08.590
I am... the Song of Healing
that you threw away, Finis.

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:17.810
I was created by a song.

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:38.080
The same scene is repeating itself.

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:44.090
Finis...

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:52.550
What's going on? Are you trying
to say something?

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:56.560
I don't understand!

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:02.150
Rin! Hang in there! Rin!

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:05.190
It's my lucky day.

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:07.610
Bazra!

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:11.740
The goddess of victory is smiling upon me.

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:14.370
Don't you agree?

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:18.750
Who knew that I'd be able to find
the girl who sings this fast.

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:24.250
A girl who sings
the Song of Healing is valuable.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:27.300
Finis destroys all,

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:29.550
and Rin heals all.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:33.390
They're the most powerful spear
and shield in the entire world.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.010
<i>Finis...</i>

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:40.980
Finis!

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:42.900
Wait!

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.070
I can't hear you!

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:47.690
I can't hear you!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:58.120
Well, well. If you dodge this,
then that girl is going to die.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:00.660
What are you going to do, Leobolt?

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:02.250
Finis!

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:04.630
Finis!

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:07.000
Help me.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:09.710
What?

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:13.340
-I heard her.
-Rin!

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.470
I heard her!

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:17.850
<i>Help me.</i>

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:20.100
I can hear a song.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:23.900
<i>Help me.</i>

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:25.770
<i>Help me.</i>

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:27.320
<i>Help me.</i>

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:28.770
<i>Help me.</i>

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:30.320
<i>Help me.</i>

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:33.400
Help me.

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:37.490
Rin...

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:53.010
The ash...

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:54.840
This sword...?

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:57.050
You bastard. What did you do?

00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:59.890
-I'll put an end to this!
-I won't let you!

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:05.730
If you call yourself a knight
of the Capital,

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:07.440
then fight with your sword!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:09.820
Fool!

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.360
Mr. Leobolt?!

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:14.070
Rin! Stay back!

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:17.160
What about Finis? Where's Finis?

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:18.530
She's not here!

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:20.870
You don't have time to talk!

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:23.120
Mr. Leobolt!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:31.090
Did you think you could win like that,
boy?

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.210
-Stop!
-Whoa.

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:35.760
Don't move.

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:41.640
-This is checkmate. Too bad.
-Leader!

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:46.600
-Leader!
-Leader, are you okay?

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:48.810
Rin!

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:50.770
-Rin!
-Are you okay?

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:51.940
You guys!

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:54.530
None of you move.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:57.570
You're alone. What are you talking about?

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:58.860
No, don't move!

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:02.290
His crossbow is loaded
with the power of songs!

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.250
If you get hit, you're dead!

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:08.960
You're pretty bright.

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:11.210
There they are! Over there!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:14.760
This is bad, Leader!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.090
I know.

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:20.890
Well... I hope you're
in excellent spirits today.

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:23.850
If you hadn't been sneaking around,

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:27.060
your village wouldn't
have been burned down.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:31.650
Amazing.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:35.610
Leobolt couldn't hit me even once.
But you could.

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:36.530
However...

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:39.450
-Rin!
-Don't move!

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:41.530
Stay there.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:45.870
Well...

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:52.340
Your job is to sing for me.

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:55.380
You don't need your arm to sing.

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:56.710
-Stop!
-Quiet!

00:18:57.210 --> 00:19:01.090
This is my parting gift to you,
to ensure you don't do anything foolish.

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:06.020
Stop...

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:09.560
Stop!

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:11.560
What?

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.150
What's going on?

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:20.740
-What are those?
-Star Bombs?!

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:22.240
That means...

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.450
Al!

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.540
Rin! I made it in time!

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:30.710
-Al!
-Whoa! Look out!

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.670
We're flying! We're flying!

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.340
That's right! We're flying!

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:39.630
How did you make that?!

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:43.930
Well, I calculated the wind resistance
and the lift force--

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.640
You can tell me later!

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:47.720
You're the one who asked!

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:49.850
Anyway, everyone is...

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:51.690
Right.

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.400
Rin, you help, too.

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:07.540
-Damn! My eyes!
-General Bazra! Are you okay?

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.710
-Now! Retreat!
-Yeah!

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:14.210
Go! Follow them!

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:17.840
You useless fools!

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:19.760
Hey! What are you doing?

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:24.140
-Hurry up and follow them!
-But with all this smoke, we probably...

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:29.600
You bastard! Leobolt!

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.440
-It worked!
-I'll drive.

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:35.060
Hold on tight!

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:44.860
-How is everything?
-The pursuers are gone!

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:46.820
We'll shake them off!

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.370
Yeah!

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:49.870
Mr. Leobolt!

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:53.040
If we keep going, we're going to reach
the road!

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:55.250
Young boy! So, it was you!

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.710
-Al!
-Yay, Al!

00:20:58.130 --> 00:21:00.420
-Yay!
-I'm glad you're all okay!

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:04.800
-Are you okay, too, Rin?
-Yeah! Thanks to all of you!

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:06.470
You're flying.

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:09.050
That's right! We're flying!

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:11.350
That's amazing! How are you doing that?

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:15.350
I calculated the wind resistance
and the lift force--

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:18.110
-You can tell me later!
-Everyone says that!

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:20.570
So, what will we do next?

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.690
Please head for Dr. Weissen's lab.

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:26.780
-I'll be waiting for you.
-Okay!

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:28.700
Hey, Al.

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:31.200
Go up one more time.

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:33.000
All right, but...

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:35.250
-Hurry!
-Okay, okay.

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:50.850
Rin, what's wrong?

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:56.480
-Finis!
-Now what are you doing?!

00:21:57.350 --> 00:21:59.810
I heard your voice!

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:05.030
I'm coming to save you, no matter what!

00:22:12.490 --> 00:22:13.490
Who was that...

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:15.750
<i>just now?</i>
